---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Ask 4 Trainings"
  description="Privacy Policy for Ask 4 Trainings — learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
>
  <section class="py-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 xl:px-0">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        Ask 4 Trainings collects information you voluntarily provide when you enquire about a course, register
        for a demo batch, or contact us via phone, email, or WhatsApp. This includes your name, email address,
        phone number, and the course or technology you're interested in.
      </p>
      <p>
        We may also automatically collect non-personal information such as browser type, device type, referring
        URLs, and pages visited using cookies and similar tracking technologies.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your enquiries and schedule demo sessions.</li>
        <li>To send you course updates, new batch notifications, and relevant training offers.</li>
        <li>To improve our website content, user experience, and training offerings.</li>
        <li>To comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personally identifiable information to outside parties
        without your consent, except as required by law or necessary to provide our services (e.g., payment
        processors).
      </p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal data against
        unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of the personal data we hold about
        you. To exercise these rights, contact us at{' '}
        <a href="mailto:ask4trainings@gmail.com" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">ask4trainings@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Ask 4 Trainings, Plot No 32/27, Door No:402, Deeksha Hospital Building, Nizampet 'X' Road, Sardar Patel Nagar, Hyderabad, Telangana, India.<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:ask4trainings@gmail.com" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">ask4trainings@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
